<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Month-calendar page of the home-screen widget (2026-10-27, user's ask: "měsíční kalendář, s čísly dnů
     a barevně odlišené služby, dovolené, služební cesty, svátky ... kalendář, rozpis, služby, kalendář").
     Included from widget_notifications.xml and hidden until NotificationsWidgetProvider switches to it.
     RemoteViews has no dynamic list/grid without an adapter service, so this is a fixed Monday-first
     6x7 grid: each day is an inner TextView (day number + fill colour set in code) inside an outer
     FrameLayout whose own background is the white "today" ring. Rows 5 and 6 are hidden in code when a
     month needs fewer weeks. The legend colours are also set in code (same per-device palette as the
     cells), the text here is just the label. -->
